    email: patriciomoreno@miuandes.cl
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/patricioamoreno/PaperCode-A-DL-enhanced-PTV-framework
abstract: >-
  Tracking pipeline combining YOLOv11 instance segmentation with a customised
  alpha-beta-gamma predictive filter to reconstruct the simultaneous
  translational and rotational trajectories of rod-like steel fibers suspended
  in a Carbopol yield-stress gel. The repository contains the training and
  tracking notebooks, the fine-tuned segmentation weights, and the trajectory
  datasets for six fiber loadings between 25 and 800 fibers.
keywords:
  - particle tracking velocimetry
  - instance segmentation
  - YOLOv11
  - rod-like particles
  - non-Newtonian fluids
  - yield-stress fluids
  - fiber dynamics
  - alpha-beta-gamma filter
  - Lagrangian tracking
license: MIT
